00:10:21,176 --> 00:10:27,176
Jeepers Creepers: Reborn is a horror film directed by Timo Vuorensola.

3
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
Forced to travel to a horror festival with her boyfriend, a young woman begins
experiencing premonitions associated with the urban myth of The Creeper.

4
00:20:42,352 --> 00:20:48,352
She believes that something supernatural has been summoned
— and that she is at the center of it all.

5
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
Laine, played by Sydney Craven.

6
00:31:03,529 --> 00:31:09,529
Chase, played by Imran Adams.

7
